WEBVTT

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.890
Miwa?

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:04.600
What is it?

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.240
Miwa is listening to the Mir's voice!

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.310
Are you all right, Miwa?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.530
I said, "Hello," to it.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.900
I told it we should talk lots.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.700
Several mechs approaching.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:20.870
They're surrounding us.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.020
It's the Human Army... Are they here to arrest us?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.620
You dummy. They're welcoming us.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.460
They're protecting us,

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.750
when there are no enemies...

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.910
This is Perseus Company.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:42.050
I'm Second Lieutenant Walter Barghest,
Captain of the Fourth Garrison.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.740
Welcome to the Srinagar area.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:48.770
Tatsumiyajima unit here.
We appreciate the welcome.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.060
They're using wide-area communications.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.470
They're supposed to attract the Festum,

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.840
but there isn't a single enemy around...

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.860
So this is that Mir's divine protection?

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:30.020
We're here. The long trip is over.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.700
Take turns watching the mechs.
Don't let anyone get close.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.060
Leave as much luggage on board as you can,

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.280
so we can get out of here fast if necessary!

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.680
So many people...

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.320
Talk about a warm welcome!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.260
They're still protecting us.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.210
Welcome to Agra Base, in the Srinagar area.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.690
I'll show you to your lodging.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.070
You've had a long journey, so rest for now.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.320
Thanks.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.930
Hey, I want to talk to it now!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.370
Wait, Miwa...

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.090
Let's rest first.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.990
You shouldn't overdo it, Miwa.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.560
I slept lots!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.480
That big tree has been calling me all this time!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.650
Miwa...

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.090
As far as we're concerned,

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.130
we'd like her to speak with the
Mir as soon as possible...

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.540
What should we do?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.660
It's our job to do as Miwa-chan says.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.330
As long as her mother permits it, of course.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.160
Just a little bit. When I say stop, you stop.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:41.920
Understand?

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.090
Yes!

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.440
Soushi-senpai?

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.730
Is something wrong?

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.360
Soushi-kun! Tatekami-san!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.090
Chizuru-sensei?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.830
Did you hear the alert? What's going on?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.740
She's awakened already?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.010
Tsubaki-chan!

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.840
Do not call me "Minashiro Tsubaki."

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:24.150
Would you wish to be called
by your mother's name?

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:25.820
"Mother"?

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.340
How long have you been conscious?

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:30.640
Since all of you set out to fight.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.800
Fight?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.980
Chizuru, bring Fumihiko and the others at once.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.360
But your exam...

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:39.650
Later. Soushi, get Kazuki.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.900
Kazuki?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:41.620
Seri.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:42.940
Y-Yes?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.360
Carry me.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.730
I can't walk well yet. Hurry.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.830
R-Right.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:00.210
We finally meet.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.670
What are you doing? Carry me.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.430
Right...

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.740
Move quickly. Everything is in motion.

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.810
Miwa and those who left the island

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.890
might die.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.060
Preparing
Rakuen

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.310
Yes, this is Café Rakuen.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.450
The island's core has woken up.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:27.540
The new core is asking for you.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.080
Take a look.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.030
People are living alongside the Mir.

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.140
They aren't enemies.

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:00.140
They're protecting us from the people.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.370
Whoa!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.830
This is the World Tree?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.670
This place is called "Varca."

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:23.250
It's the old well where Emery
received her Mir fragment.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.170
"Well"? Like the kind you draw water from?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.880
Well, we can't get water from it anymore, of course.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.720
Don't run! It's dangerous!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.640
A shrine?

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.800
It's beautiful...

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.070
Isn't it amazing, Mama?

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:20.510
Excuse me...

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.190
May we film this?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.470
Of course.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.360
We want you to tell your brethren
everything about us.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.030
A child?

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.870
He's gone.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:56.680
Leave!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.270
What was that?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.340
Just a Gregory-type.

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:07.690
The spirits of assimilated humans
wander here like ghosts.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.110
Ghosts?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.050
They act as parasites on our Mir.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.690
They don't harm humans.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:22.810
This is the bottom of Varca,

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.260
where you'll speak with the Mir.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.330
Let's go.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.380
Miwa...

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.970
Wow!

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.710
No!

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:37.290
If I were bigger, I could do it...

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.430
You mustn't grow bigger that way.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.820
You'll lose far too much.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:53.090
Miwa!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.230
What happened?

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:02.610
There was a big star.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:06.980
But I can't talk to it because I'm still little.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:10.390
She made contact with Altair on her first attempt?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.700
But Miwa is too young to speak with it,

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:16.320
so the Mir tried to make her grow.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.530
What?!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.400
Because she wished to be bigger...

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.740
But it'll be okay. I'll protect her,

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:25.940
and so will everyone here.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.660
Out of the six Azazel-types,

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.710
Roadrunner is confirmed to be on the move.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:46.030
It's most likely heading for the Srinagar area.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.040
And Walker is still traveling over the Pacific.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.100
Probably in pursuit of that island.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.650
Shall we inform General Narain?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.610
The general, and that island, have forgotten
the noble sacrifices of the past,

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.070
and are about to make a very foolish choice.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.570
They've chosen to assimilate with the enemy

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.700
and abandon their dignity as humans.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:13.000
This choice destroys the plan to rescue humanity,
the Triple Plan, at its very foundation.

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.170
Then...

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:18.250
I declare ROE Alpha.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.560
With all due respect,

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:25.590
General Narain holds great influence
over the Human Army.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:28.740
There is no need to oppose the general.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:32.310
Offensive measures will target only those
who have assimilated with Festum.

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:35.160
Relay that to the Asian fleet.

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:36.850
Understood.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:41.170
We will destroy the new Mir that
the monsters are bringing here,

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:45.280
and return the absolute right to
exist on this planet to humans.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:50.750
I'm sure the general would be honored
to become a sacrifice to that cause.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.380
Thank you.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.980
It isn't too tight, Tsubaki-chan?

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.000
Why are you surprised?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:21.070
Were you not the ones who wanted
the core to act as a human,

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.430
in order to teach the island's
Mir about life and death?

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:27.360
We didn't think you would awaken so soon.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.230
Remaining young would only
bring about my destruction.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:33.290
That is what the Mir and I believed.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.960
Did the Azazel-type pursuing the island cause this?

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:39.050
It was because you all chose to fight.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:41.350
Not for peace, but for hope.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:43.630
You mean we shouldn't have chosen that?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:47.200
I do not oppose your choice.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:51.300
It is my duty to protect you on
the path you have chosen.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:52.470
Protect...

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.550
Soushi, Kazuki.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.020
Go and protect Miwa at once.

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.560
Are you saying danger is at hand?

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:02.930
Once it comes, it will be too late.

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:06.950
You participated in the scramble for the new Mir.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.100
Scramble?

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.950
You mean with the Azazel-types, said to
be numerous throughout the world?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.040
Both they and humans will become the enemy.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.310
Enemy?

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:20.610
Do you wish to say that Minashiro Tsubaki
would never use such a term?

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:21.960
No, u-um...

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.800
Why Kazuki and Soushi-kun?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.500
Because they are two powers as one.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:31.990
In addition, you intended
to abandon both of them.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.150
Wait a minute!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:36.810
You're telling us to put them in
Mark Sein and Mark Nicht?!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.410
What other choice is there?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.610
You may as well be ordering them to their deaths!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:43.150
Kazuki-kun's body is... And Soushi-kun, too...

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.080
That is a blessing to all of you.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:52.860
Pain, suffering, and the power
granted to none but you.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:57.180
And your finite lives. They are all blessings.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:02.830
How will you bless the world?

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.160
I will do as the core commands,

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.260
just as I always have.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.110
I'll go, too.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.440
Kazuki...

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.220
If you're going, so will I.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:19.830
Kodate-san, Hazama-sensei, please.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.160
If we're unable to control them,

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.810
use the Fenrir equipped in the Stone Coffin.

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:31.360
Don't worry. I'll make sure they start up.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:32.830
Kodate-san...

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.280
We only need to protect Miwa-chan?

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:37.200
Not only Miwa.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.700
Protect everything Miwa wishes for.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.870
Toumi and all the others are in danger, too?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.860
As is the hope you have chosen.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.780
May I ask one more question?

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:51.510
What?

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.540
What's your name?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:54.610
I don't have one yet.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.450
Fumihiko.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.390
It's coming.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.280
Report from the CDC.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.190
It's an Azazel-type.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.020
Prepare to intercept.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:15.390
The Fafner unit will start up the system,
under the second-in-command.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.910
Not Soushi-kun?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:19.490
Makabe Kazuki, Minashiro Soushi...

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:22.660
Prepare for the expedition off
the island immediately.

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:23.510
Yes, sir.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.250
Seri.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.860
Y-Yes?

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.750
Give me a name.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:30.920
Huh?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:34.220
You will choose my name. Is that a problem?

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.590
Um... No.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.390
Then repel the enemy.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.140
I'll hear your decision after that.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.440
All machines are ready at the deployment dock.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.610
Prepare the cockpit block.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:53.740
What? Why are they using Sein?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:01.950
Sorry I'm late!

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:05.060
Mai-san? Were you on CDC duty?

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:06.810
Yeah, in Olga-san's place.

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.630
You could've let us take care of the battle.

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:12.630
I've let you guys take care of everything.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.300
I'm scared, but I'll do my best.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.720
Enemy mech, code name Walker,
heading straight for the island.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.220
All shields are up. Standing by to intercept.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.640
You're watching the battle from here?

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:27.960
Minashiro Tsubaki had the power
to read everyone's minds

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.250
and convey what was in them to both
the enemy and the island's Mir.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.540
So during battles, she wanted to be outside.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:38.550
But my power is a bit different, so I'll stay here.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.580
Your power?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.010
You really did wake up.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:48.610
Chizuru-sensei said you haven't had your exam yet.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:51.250
That can wait until after your job is finished.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.170
Can they do it?

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.840
I'll bring them all back alive.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.400
You can still turn back.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:22.760
I've always thought about how I
wanted to live out my end.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.610
Same here.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.330
Is your left eye okay?

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:30.750
It's the same as yours. I lost the sight,
then got it back.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.300
We've defeated so many enemies,

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:37.170
yet it's the power of the Festum that keeps us alive.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.490
That's why we can pilot Sein and Nicht.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.560
But since the system is integrated,

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.110
the limiters have been removed for the dismantling.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.080
The assimilation phenomenon will hit hard.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:51.110
One slip, and we could sink the island.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.770
You and I can do this.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:55.980
Right?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.700
Kazuki!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.790
Sorry. It turns out I have to go.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:11.770
But that's...

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:17.170
Don't do it! You've already... And still...

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.850
And still...

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.980
Why do you have to go?

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:32.990
I've thought about it a lot.

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:35.730
I've struggled with it a lot.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.560
Today, I was taught how I can use my life.

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.910
Don't go, Kazuki! Please don't go!

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:00.230
I've felt all along that it was calling for me.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.220
It wanted me to tell it why it's here.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.150
Thanks for trying to stop me.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:26.690
You always do that...

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:32.290
You shatter my heart without even
hearing what I have to say...

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.480
No abnormalities.

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:46.260
You must be tired. You should rest,
as well, Yumiko-san.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.550
Thanks. You rest, too.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:49.390
I will.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.380
Miwa?

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.410
It hurts, Mama!

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:24.550
Miwa!

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.540
It hurts...

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.510
My arms and legs hurt!

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:33.580
Are you Miwa?

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.440
Damn it! When did they breach our defense line?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.740
The defense force has vanished?

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:52.160
Yes, sir. The western defense stronghold may
be nonfunctional, for unknown reasons.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.500
Emergency dispatch of all units on base!

00:21:57.230 --> 00:22:00.170
Have the guard force protect
the people of D Island!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.750
Enemy in the city! It's a Delphine-type!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.260
What?

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.360
Mizoguchi-san!

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:12.850
An enemy?

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:15.890
I don't know. Gather everyone now!

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.400
Not Miwa... Not Miwa, please!

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:34.240
It was for peace that we'd fought.

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:39.170
No matter how short-lived,
peace was everything to us.

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:45.410
But this time, for the sake of an unknown hope,

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:50.100
we chose to use our lives.

